       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PERFCALC.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.

       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT CUSTMAST ASSIGN TO CUSTMAST.

       DATA DIVISION.

       FILE SECTION.

       FD  CUSTMAST.

       01  CUSTOMER-MASTER-RECORD.
           05  CM-BRANCH-NUMBER        PIC 9(2).
           05  CM-SALESREP-NUMBER      PIC 9(2).
           05  CM-CUSTOMER-NUMBER      PIC 9(5).
           05  CM-CUSTOMER-NAME        PIC X(20).
           05  CM-SALES-THIS-YTD       PIC S9(5)V9(2).
           05  CM-SALES-LAST-YTD       PIC S9(5)V9(2).
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(57).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  SWITCHES.
           05  CUSTMAST-EOF-SWITCH     PIC X    VALUE "N".
           05  TEMP                     PIC S9(5)V9(2).
           05  TEMP-FORMATTED           PIC ZZ,ZZ9.99-.

       COPY CUSTDATA.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LS-MAXIMUM-FIELDS.
           05 LS-HIGHTEST-SALES-THIS-YEAR    PIC S9(5)V99.
           05 LS-HIGHEST-SALES-THIS-YEAR-NM  PIC X(20).
           05 LS-MOST-IMPROVED-THIS-YEAR     PIC S9(5)V99.
           05 LS-MOSTIMPROVED-THIS-YEAR-NM   PIC X(20).


       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-MAXIMUM-FIELDS.

       000-PREPARE-SALES-REPORT.

           OPEN INPUT  CUSTMAST.
           PERFORM 001-INITALIZE-VALUES.
           PERFORM 200-PREPARE-SALES-LINES
               UNTIL CUSTMAST-EOF-SWITCH = "Y".
           PERFORM 300-REPORT-TOP-PERFORMERS.
           CLOSE CUSTMAST.

           MOVE WS-MAXIMUM-FIELDS TO LS-MAXIMUM-FIELDS.
      *     STOP RUN.
           GOBACK.

       001-INITALIZE-VALUES.
           MOVE ZERO TO TOP-CONTRIBUTORS.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-CUSTOMER-INFORMATION.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-MAXIMUM-FIELDS.

       200-PREPARE-SALES-LINES.

           PERFORM 210-READ-CUSTOMER-RECORD.
           IF CUSTMAST-EOF-SWITCH = "N"
               PERFORM 220-CALCULATE-TOP-PERFORMER.

       210-READ-CUSTOMER-RECORD.

           READ CUSTMAST
               AT END
                   MOVE "Y" TO CUSTMAST-EOF-SWITCH.

       220-CALCULATE-TOP-PERFORMER.
      * PERFORM READING IN OF VALUES
           MOVE CM-CUSTOMER-NUMBER  TO WS-CUSTOMER-NUMBER.
           MOVE CM-CUSTOMER-NAME    TO WS-CUSTOMER-NAME.
           MOVE CM-SALES-THIS-YTD   TO WS-SALES-THIS-YEAR.
           MOVE CM-SALES-LAST-YTD   TO WS-SALES-LAST-YEAR.

           DISPLAY "-----CUSTOMER SUMMARY------".
           DISPLAY "CUSTOMER NAME: " WS-CUSTOMER-NAME.
           MOVE WS-SALES-THIS-YEAR TO TEMP-FORMATTED.
            DISPLAY "SALES THIS YEAR: " TEMP-FORMATTED.
           MOVE WS-SALES-LAST-YEAR TO TEMP-FORMATTED.
            DISPLAY "SALES LAST YEAR: " TEMP-FORMATTED.
           SUBTRACT WS-SALES-LAST-YEAR FROM WS-SALES-THIS-YEAR
                GIVING TEMP.
           MOVE TEMP to TEMP-FORMATTED.
            DISPLAY "DIFFERENCE IN SALES: " TEMP-FORMATTED.
            DISPLAY "-----END CUSTOMER SUMMARY-----".

      * CALL CLCTPCTB.
           CALL 'CLCTPCTB' using WS-CUSTOMER-INFORMATION
                            WS-MAXIMUM-FIELDS.

            DISPLAY '-----AFTER CALL MAXIMUM-FIELDS-----'.
            MOVE WS-HIGHEST-SALES-THIS-YEAR TO TEMP-FORMATTED.
            DISPLAY
            'HIGHEST SALES THIS YEAR: ' WS-HIGHEST-SALES-THIS-YEAR-NM.
            DISPLAY "AMOUNT: " TEMP-FORMATTED.
            MOVE WS-MOST-IMPROVED-THIS-YEAR TO TEMP-FORMATTED.
            DISPLAY
            "MOST IMPROVED THIS YEAR: " WS-MOST-IMPROVED-THIS-YEAR.
            DISPLAY "AMOUNT: " TEMP-FORMATTED.


       300-REPORT-TOP-PERFORMERS.
           MOVE WS-MOST-IMPROVED-THIS-YEAR to FMT-MOST-IMPROVED-AMOUNT.
           MOVE WS-HIGHEST-SALES-THIS-YEAR to FMT-HIGHEST-SALES-AMOUNT.

           MOVE WS-HIGHEST-SALES-THIS-YEAR-NM to
                HIGHEST-SALES-THIS-YR-NAME.
           MOVE WS-MOST-IMPROVED-THIS-YEAR-NM to
                MOST-IMPROVED-THIS-YR-NAME.

           DISPLAY 'CONGRATULATIONS to the highest sales this year: '.
           DISPLAY HIGHEST-SALES-THIS-YR-NAME ' with sales of '
      -         FMT-HIGHEST-SALES-AMOUNT.
           DISPLAY " ".
           DISPLAY 'CONGRATULATIONS to the most improved sales this '
      -         ' year: '.
           DISPLAY MOST-IMPROVED-THIS-YR-NAME ' with a '
      -          'difference in sales of ' FMT-MOST-IMPROVED-AMOUNT.